{
  "car_model": "Mercedes-Benz: Sprinter W906 OM651 (EU)",
  "note": "Experimental, EU vehicles only (US Sprinter NCV3 profiles are not compatible). Needs a firmware with the ATWU wake-up commands, see W906.md in github.com/mcgyver78/WiCAN_W906.",
  "comment": "Engine ECU Delphi CRD3 on 7E0/7E8 (UDS). DIDs and scaling were matched against the Xentry actual values page 'Eingaenge - Sensoren' of a 2016 316 CDI (max. deviation within Xentry display rounding). CAN captures show the diagnostic bus starting its traffic right after the first tester frame to 7E0, so a physical TesterPresent (padded with 55 like Xentry) is used as wake-up frame.",
